      "body": "### The problem\n\nHello!\n\nAt some point on Mar 30 while I was on 2026.4.0b5, my Chess.com integration started failing.\n\n<img width=\"299\" height=\"127\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dad6e443-00cd-4b05-aaa4-594a5f146e79\" />\n\nwith these logs\n\n```\n\u001b[31m2026-03-30 18:18:31.009 ERROR (MainThread) [homeassistant.components.chess_com.coordinator] Error fetching Name Name data: Error communicating with Chess.com: Resource not found: An internal error has occurred. Please contact Chess.com Developer's Forum for further help https://www.chess.com/club/chess-com-developer-community\n```\nand debug just shows this:\n\n```\n\u001b[36m2026-03-31 09:10:24.352 DEBUG (MainThread) [homeassistant.components.chess_com.coordinator] Finished fetching Name Name data in 0.136 seconds (success: False)\u001b[0m\n```\n\nI can see the profile at `https://www.chess.com/member/username`, that works\n\nim not sure what changed. Happy to provide more information if requested.\n\n### What version of Home Assistant Core has the issue?\n\n2026.4.0b4\n\n### What was the last working version of Home Assistant Core?\n\nmaybe b0 to b3?\n\n### What type of installation are you running?\n\nHome Assistant OS\n\n### Integration causing the issue\n\nChess.com\n\n### Link to integration documentation on our website\n\nhttps://rc.home-assistant.io/integrations/chess_com\n\n### Diagnostics information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Example YAML snippet\n\n```yaml\n\n```\n\n### Anything in the logs that might be useful for us?\n\n```txt\n\n```\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
